[[../../../../scripts/test_changed.py relationship source]]
end note
runner -->[executes static and contract gates\ncontract: blocking assertions] "Architecture and Contract Gates\nResponsibility: Enforce boundaries and anti-hardcoding policy\nContract: Behavioral assertions\n[[../../../../tests/gates/test_table_b_anti_hardcoding_gate.py source]]" as gates
note on link
[[../../../../tests/run_tests.py relationship source]]
end note
runner -->[executes boundary proof\ncontract: disposable test environment] "Integration and E2E\nResponsibility: Prove real authority boundaries and user paths\nContract: Disposable dependencies and production path\n[[../../../../tests/integration/test_story_runtime_experience.py source]]" as integration
note on link
[[../../../../tests/run_tests.py relationship source]]
end note
gates -->[emits findings\ncontract: selected/executed truth] "Evidence Reporter\nResponsibility: Expose selected, executed, skipped and failed scope\nContract: Machine-readable and human summary\n[[../../../../tests/reports/RUNNER_CI_TRUTH_MATRIX.md source]]" as report
note on link
